// The item-key -> routine dispatch for BUNDLE items that are usable. A bundle ships the
// def AND the routine: bundles/<b>/items/<item_key>.loft exposing `pub fn apply`, where
// the FILE NAME is the key -- so the engine names neither. Engine-owned item effects
